These files are taken from Sebastian Eck's MIDI conversion of the Essen
Folksong Collection:

    Eck, Sebastian. Essen Folksong Database (Conversion & Tokenization).
    Kaggle dataset.
    https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/sebastianeck/essen-folksong-database-conversion-and-tokenization

The underlying folksong encodings originate from the Essen Folksong Collection
(EsAC / Humdrum **kern), compiled under the supervision of Helmut Schaffrath
and prepared in kern format by David Huron:

    Schaffrath, Helmut. The Essen Folksong Collection in Kern Format
